   Questions and Answers was written by Janne Kukonlehto for GNU
   Midnight Commander.  Parts of it originate from Ian Jackson, Miguel
   de Icaza, Dugan Porter, Norbert Warmuth and Paul Sheer.  It was
   rewritten for coole, keeping the answers that concern the editor and
   the terminal.

10.2 Feedback is invited

   Send your comments about this document and about the program to
   https://github.com/blue-panels/coole/issues .

